{"role":"assistant","content":"Рабочее дерево чистое. Вношу правку в `build_system`.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_sF6OvdFr8HQNypN29w0BA2Dg","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"bot.py\",\"old_string\":\"def build_system(a, today):\\n    # One block, cached as a whole: instructions + per-athlete context.\\n    text = INSTRUCTIONS + \\\"\\\\n\\\\n\\\" + athlete_context(a, today)\\n    return [{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"text\\\": text, \\\"cache_control\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"ephemeral\\\"}}]\",\"new_string\":\"def build_system(a, today):\\n    # Two cache segments: the byte-stable instructions, then the per-athlete tail.\\n    # A save_fact write changes only the tail, so the instructions stay cached.\\n    return [\\n        {\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"text\\\": INSTRUCTIONS, \\\"cache_control\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"ephemeral\\\"}},\\n        {\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"\\\\n\\\\n\\\" + athlete_context(a, today), \\\"cache_control\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"ephemeral\\\"}},\\n    ]\"}"}}]}
