{"role":"assistant","content":"Обновлю упоминание кеширования в README, чтобы документация соответствовала коду.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_hpoAy0CQAYkUKWdBF1khdE7M","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"new_string\":\"Requires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system\\nprompt is split into two `cache_control` segments — the static coaching rules and the\\nper-athlete tail (date, profile, zones, goal, facts) — so a `save_fact` write re-caches\\nonly the tail, while the tool-loop rounds and follow-up messages inside the 5-minute\\nwindow keep reading the bulk of the prompt from cache.\",\"old_string\":\"Requires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system\\nprompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up\\nmessages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.\",\"path\":\"README.md\"}"}}]}
